// Chapter 6: a palette. The colors of the ZX Spectrum: eight colors, then the same eight, brighter.
// One color on each line: two hexadecimal digits for red, two for green, two for blue.
000000    //  0: black
0000D7    //  1: blue
D70000    //  2: red
D700D7    //  3: magenta
00D700    //  4: green
00D7D7    //  5: cyan
D7D700    //  6: yellow
D7D7D7    //  7: white
000000    //  8: black
0000FF    //  9: bright blue
FF0000    // 10: bright red
FF00FF    // 11: bright magenta
00FF00    // 12: bright green
00FFFF    // 13: bright cyan
FFFF00    // 14: bright yellow
FFFFFF    // 15: bright white
